  "prefLabel": "Phy 103.04 Board Meetings and Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 103.04 Board Meetings and Quorum.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 328-A:3, III, the board shall elect officers from its members, as necessary.\n\n(b) A majority of the members appointed by the governor constitutes a quorum.\n\nSource. #9039, eff 11-26-05; ss by #12993, eff 2-22-20 (formerly Phy 103.05) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Phy 100); ss by #14385, eff 9-23-25",
